;; Envelope allocations (PLAN.md §5.2).
;;
;; Deliberately empty until real cash exists in the ledger: `available(asof)
;; = budgeted cash - Σ balance(E)`, so allocating against zero cash would
;; make `bookkeeper verify`'s over-allocation check fail from the very first
;; commit. Uncomment/adjust the starter budget below once a sync (or an
;; opening-balance transaction) has put money in Assets:Checking.
;;
;; 2026-01-01 custom "envelope" "allocate" "Groceries"       600.00 USD
;; 2026-01-01 custom "envelope" "allocate" "Dining Out"       200.00 USD
;; 2026-01-01 custom "envelope" "allocate" "Transport"        150.00 USD
;; 2026-01-01 custom "envelope" "allocate" "Rent"            1200.00 USD
;; 2026-01-01 custom "envelope" "allocate" "Utilities"        150.00 USD
;; 2026-01-01 custom "envelope" "allocate" "Subscriptions"     60.00 USD
;; 2026-01-01 custom "envelope" "allocate" "Health"           100.00 USD
